00:14:10.814 --> 00:14:11.815
Takeda, teruskan begitu.

00:14:13.317 --> 00:14:16.120
Sakit. Berhenti.

00:14:16.987 --> 00:14:18.989
Lakuin lagi. Sakit, sakit.

